      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The county's hotellingHourFraction: 47 rows at zone 261610 -- the weekday's 24 hours (sum 0.935) and the weekend's 23 (sum 0.953; hour 8 has no row and keeps its default share). AdjustHotelling.sql's second block (`hot_hourShare`). MOVES cuts it to the run's hours in the execution database. MOVES merges it into the execution database cut to the RunSpec's hours -- 3 of the 47 rows, both days' hour 7 and the weekday's hour 8 -- so only those hours are rescaled (`hot_hourFractionRows`; PLAN.md §7.3.61); a one-year run's defaults cannot tell the difference.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
